    "body": "Hey @thisac, \r\nThe one extra line that is now not covered but was previously is the last line from this:\r\n```\r\n        # TODO: use self.diff_method when that value gets updated\r\n        if self.diff_method != \"best\":\r\n            info[\"diff_method\"] = self.diff_method\r\n        else:\r\n            info[\"diff_method\"] = self.qtape.jacobian_options[\"method\"]\r\n```\r\nThis is the original code which is run from the `specs` property of `QNode`.\r\nAfter this PR, we will never have a case where `self.diff_method == \"best\"`; thus, the last line has become redundant. Still, I have not removed this to stay safe. We can do this later when it is sure that there will be no side effects.",
